---

<section class="hero inverted">
  <div class="container content">
    <h1>We build websites and software.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      We are two students in web development and programming. AquaWorld, an aquatic pet
      store, is the project that shows what we can build.
    </p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a href="/#services" class="btn">See our services</a>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn btn-outline">Contact us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    color: var(--fg);
    background: var(--bg);
    /* Extra top space clears the absolutely positioned header. */
    padding-block: 9rem 6rem;
  }
  .content { display: grid; gap: 1.75rem; max-width: 60rem; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 9vw, 6.5rem); line-height: 0.95; }
  .lead { max-width: 40rem; font-size: 1.35rem; line-height: 1.35; }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
</style>